        {
          "id": "whow02b",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family:Fraunces;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:300;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:#1A1A1C;max-width:760px;margin:0;border-left:2px solid #B85C3C;padding-left:20px\">Apical &mdash; perfect from day one. HIPAA-compliant, sterilized appliance in the doctor&rsquo;s hand, available to the practicing dentist.</p>",
            "_animation": "fadeInUp",
            "_animation_delay": 160
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "whow03",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:40px;font-family:Inter;margin-top:24px\"><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(26,26,28,0.1);padding:36px 32px\"><div style=\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A1A1C;color:#F3EEE5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:24px\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"/><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"/><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"/><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M12 5v2M12 17v2M5 12h2M17 12h2\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-family:Fraunces;font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#1A1A1C;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.15\">Scan &amp; plan</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(26,26,28,0.78);margin:0\">Intraoral scan plus a cone-beam CT feed our planning AI. Surgical trajectory ready before the patient is seated.</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(184,92,60,0.35);padding:36px 32px\"><div style=\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#B85C3C;color:#F3EEE5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:24px\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 2v5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"2.2\" r=\"0.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M9 16.5h6\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-family:Fraunces;font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#1A1A1C;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.15\">Robot-guided surgery</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(26,26,28,0.78);margin:0\">Haptic-feedback arm places the implant to surgical-grade accuracy, supervised by a remote specialist on your team.</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(26,26,28,0.1);padding:36px 32px\"><div style=\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A1A1C;color:#F3EEE5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:24px\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3c-2.6 0-4.2 1.4-5.1 2.9-1 1.6-1.4 3.4-1.4 5 0 1.4.4 2.7.8 4 .4 1.4.7 2.8.9 4.2.2 1.5.6 2.9 1.6 2.9 1.1 0 1.4-1.6 1.7-3.2.2-1.1.4-2.2.5-2.5.1-.3.5-.3.6 0 .1.3.3 1.4.5 2.5.3 1.6.6 3.2 1.7 3.2 1 0 1.4-1.4 1.6-2.9.2-1.4.5-2.8.9-4.2.4-1.3.8-2.6.8-4 0-1.6-.4-3.4-1.4-5C16.2 4.4 14.6 3 12 3z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-family:Fraunces;font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#1A1A1C;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.15\">Same-day restoration</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(26,26,28,0.78);margin:0\">Chairside crown milling and temporary placement before the patient leaves &mdash; no second visit required.</p></div></div><style>@media (max-width:900px){[data-id=\"whow03\"] > div{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;gap:20px !important;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}[data-id=\"whow03\"] > div > div{padding:28px 26px !important}}@media (max-width:420px){[data-id=\"whow03\"] > div > div{padding:24px 22px !important}}</style>",
            "_animation": "fadeInUp",
            "_animation_delay": 200
          }
        }
      ]
    }
